  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed first floor rear/side extension individually and proposed extension cumulatively due to their inappropriate size and scale would fail to appear subservient and proportionate to the host dwelling. This would result in harm to the overall character of the site and surrounding area, contrary to Part A5 of the Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD and Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations).  ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed first floor side/rear extension due to its size, scale and positioning, would result in an increased sense of enclosure and overbearingness that would harm the living conditions of neighbouring properties. The proposed development would therefore be contrary to Local Plan Policies CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) and the intent of Part A5 of the Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD.\r\n"
  ],
